zure: azure_ad\n  - Control `Audit Logging`: required → aws: aws_cloudtrail, aws_cloudwatch; gcp: gcp_cloud_monitoring, gcp_cloud_logging; azure: azure_monitor\n  - Control `Network Segmentation`: required → aws: aws_waf, aws_network_firewall; gcp: gcp_cloud_armor; azure: azure_waf, azure_firewall\n  - Control `Vulnerability Management`: required → aws: aws_waf, aws_guardduty, aws_inspector; gcp: gcp_cloud_armor, gcp_security_scanner; azure: azure_waf, azure_defender, azure_sentinel\n\nGDPR: EU regulation on data protection and privacy for individuals within the European Union\n  - Control `Encryption at Rest`: required → aws: aws_kms; gcp: gcp_kms; azure: azure_key_vault\n  - Control `Encryption in Transit`: required → aws: aws_alb, aws_api_gateway, aws_cloudfront; gcp: gcp_lb, gcp_cloud_cdn; azure: azure_agw, azure_front_door\n  - Control `Access Control`: required → aws: aws_iam, aws_cognito; gcp: gcp_iam; azure: azure_ad\n  - Control `Audit Logging`: required → aws: aws_cloudtrail, aws_cloudwatch; gcp: gcp_cloud_monitoring, gcp_cloud_logging; azure: azure_monitor\n  - Control `Data Residency`: required → aws: aws_s3, aws_rds, aws_aurora; gcp: gcp_storage, gcp_cloud_sql, gcp_spanner; azure: azure_blob, azure_sql, azure_cosmos_db\n  - Control `Breach Notification`: required → aws: aws_cloudwatch, aws_sns, aws_guardduty; gcp: gcp_cloud_monitoring, gcp_pubsub; azure: azure_monitor, azure_sentinel\n\nSOC 2: Trust Services Criteria for security, availability, processing integrity, confidentiality, and privacy\n  - Control `Encryption at Rest`: required → aws: aws_kms; gcp: gcp_kms; azure: azure_key_vault\n  - Control `Encryption in Transit`: required → aws: aws_alb, aws_api_gateway, aws_cloudfront; gcp: gcp_lb, gcp_cloud_cdn; azure: azure_agw, azure_front_door\n  - Control `Access Control`: required → aws: aws_iam, aws_cognito; gcp: gcp_iam; azure: azure_ad\n  - Control `Audit Logging`: required → aws: aws_cloudtrail, aws_cloudwatch; gcp: gcp_cloud_monitoring, gcp_cloud_logging; azure: azure_monitor\n  - Control `Availability`: required → aws: aws_elb, aws_alb, aws_rds, aws_ecs, aws_eks; gcp: gcp_lb, gcp_cloud_sql, gcp_gke; azure: azure_lb, azure_agw, azure_sql, azure_aks\n  - Control `Confidentiality`: required → aws: aws_secrets_manager, aws_kms; gcp: gcp_kms, gcp_secret_manager; azure: azure_key_vault\n\nNAIC: Insurance data security model law requiring protection of consumer information\n  - Control `Encryption at Rest`: required → aws: aws_kms; gcp: gcp_kms; azure: azure_key_vault\n  - Control `Encryption in Transit`: required → aws: aws_alb, aws_api_gateway, aws_cloudfront; gcp: gcp_lb, gcp_cloud_cdn; azure: azure_agw, azure_front_door\n  - Control `Access Control`: required → aws: aws_iam, aws_cognito; gcp: gcp_iam; azure: azure_ad\n  - Control `Audit Logging`: required → aws: aws_cloudtrail, aws_cloudwatch; gcp: gcp_cloud_monitoring, gcp_cloud_logging; azure: azure_monitor\n  - Control `Network Segmentation`: required → aws: aws_waf, aws_network_firewall; gcp: gcp_cloud_armor; azure: azure_waf, azure_firewall\n  - Control `Incident Response`: required → aws: aws_cloudwatch, aws_guardduty, aws_sns; gcp: gcp_cloud_monitoring, gcp_pubsub; azure: azure_monitor, azure_sentinel\n\nThe diagram contains these cloud services (in Draw.io XML format):\n<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="... (truncated, 9109 total chars)'}
